export anchor SpecRefactoring:
    base:
        Refactoring spec should be done when

        - The same text or the same properties in two or more anchors.
        - A file with more than one exported anchor.
        - An anchor that holds more than one topic.
        - A folder that holds unrelated topics, or too many files.
        - A base or a folder that has no purpose now.

        A refactor must not change the meaning of the specification. A refactor
        that renames an export or moves more than 5 files needs approval from
        the user first.
